{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>That he was good.</b> Beautiful, as in כִּי טֹבֹת הֵנָּה (Genesis 6:2). She saw that he was more beautiful than what was customary, and she thought that this was for an intended end from his Maker — for indeed beauty of form indicates excellence of the matter's temperament and the perfection of the formative power."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:57.438755843Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}